window.products.push({"id":358079,"name":"Chefn Olle Pepper Grinder and Salt Grinder Set, Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31KrM+oFtAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Chef’n continues its revolutionary one-handed design with the Olle™ grinders. Along with this innovative feature, the Olle™ grinders offer a sophisticated, sleek form with counter and tabletop appeal. Filled with fresh Spanish Sea Salt or a Global Pepper Medley, the grinders flavor meals with a quick squeeze. The patented GrindTune™ lever on the base adjusts the coarseness of the grind while the top of the grinder can easily be removed for a quick and simple refill. The Olle™ grinders are available in trend-forward colors and a have new carbon steel rasp for a higher output level. Amazon.com Olle offers the legendary Chef'n one-handed grinding operation in a sleek new styling. A single lever on one side is squeezed to produce freshly ground salt or pepper out the bottom. This set includes two grinders, one for salt with a corrosion-resistant ceramic mechanism, and one for pepper with a new carbon-steel rasp that grinds peppercorns more efficiently. Both feature the GrindTune adjustment that lets you choose any grind from coarse to fine. The clear body of each lets you monitor the content level. Chef'n offers the seven-inch set in a choice of finishes, pre-fills the grinders with sea salt crystals and peppercorns, and covers the grinders with a limited lifetime warranty. Chef'n approaches housewares with a creative mind and sense of humor. Innovations are its signature element, an approach started by founder and self-proclaimed Famous Inventor, David Holcomb, with his Garlic Machine in 1982. From rabbit-eared pepper grinders to collapsible colanders, Chef'n delights as it brings fresh seasoning to the kitchen and home. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31KrM+oFtAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef'n","source_asin":"B00138TCGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00138TCGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00138TCGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
