window.products.push({"id":358157,"name":"Mickey Door Hooks,Disney Mickey Mouse Cartoon Animation Coat Hooks,Key Holder,Key Hanger for Wall、Entryway and Living Room -Unigue Gift-5 Hooks-20LB(M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m-KfL0PDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Disney Mickey Mouse Key Hooks Colour: Black Material: Wood Length: 30CM Number of hooks: 5 The maximum weight: 20LB Packing: Carton Package weight: About 0.25KG Packing size: 31*21*5CM The back of the hook is 3M glue (double-sided tape) Design Concept: \"Mickey Mouse\" is a memory of each of us, accompanied by our growth. Fix this on the wall of your entryway and it is sure to grab the attention of guests entering who will be full of smiles and praises. A wall hook with a eye-catching sign is something just perfect for the hallway. This one here is made from good quality black wood 3mm thick and will last in prim condition for a long time. It features five hooks made of metal. Use these hooks to hang keys, coats, sling bags or cloth bags. So well carved, it is sure to make the walls it is mounted on captivating. Light in weight, 3M backing on the back, easy to install, can be attached to any wall, and equipped with 2 screws, this wall hook is easy to fix. Please note: The rack board is handmade of 3mm black basswood,NOT iron metal.But still strong enough to support around 20 lbs (9 kg) of weight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m-KfL0PDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YSDESIGN","source_asin":"B07XZD1812","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XZD1812","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XZD1812","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":358158,"name":"Sugar Vine Art Sunflower Field Clock Beach Clock Large 10.5\" Wall Clock Decorative Round Circle Clock Home Decor Novelty Clock Yellow, Green Leaves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3wKKDvmL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"This is not a wood clock. This is an image custom printed onto an OPEN FACE CLOCK with no cover over the top. This clock does not need a frame. It is a rigid thick hard base clock face with a quartz clock movement mounted on the back. There is a built-in hanger on the back of the clock movement for easy hanging. Each clock in the shop is handmade to order. This is not a store bought plastic clock and the face is almost twice the size of competitors. All parts including the quartz clock movement are made in the USA. CLOCK DETAILS: Large 10.5\" Open face means no cover or frame. Thick hard base. Quartz clock movement made in USA, Guaranteed 2 yrs, AA battery not included. Large 4.5\" metal (not plastic) hands. Recommended for indoor use not outdoor. The printed face can be personalized free if you choose. You will just need to send me a message through the message system. The high resolution image is printed using a large format professional laser jet printer producing sharp pictures with vivid colors. This is NOT meant to be an outdoor clock. Each clock is made to order. Printing and assembling will take 2 business days to process. You should receive your clock within 7 business days after payment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3wKKDvmL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sugar Vine Art","source_asin":"B01HITV9NM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HITV9NM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HITV9NM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
