window.products.push({"id":358164,"name":"Lekoch 20pcs Paper Napkin Holders Rings Serviette Buckles,Creative Cardboard Towel Napkin Rings for DIY Party,Christmas,Halloween，Hotel,Home,Wedding,C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oexUAkgpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cute animal design: Cute animal pattern napkin rings, with different animal shapes, suitable for children’s birthday parties, Christmas, Easter, wedding parties and other themed parties. Eco-friendly cardboard material: Recyclable cardboard, thick enough for one use, and reusable napkin ring. Table decoration: On the one hand, animal paper napkins can make the table tidy, and on the other hand, the napkin rings can play a very good decorative role, becoming a must-have for decorating napkins at the dinner party. Packing: 20 pcs/piece in a box, panda circle: Φ4cm, deer circle: Φ4.5cm; cat circle: 4.5cm More animal patterns: Customers are welcome to submit animal patterns, and we welcome more design possibilities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oexUAkgpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lekoch","source_asin":"B098NSP261","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098NSP261","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098NSP261","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":358165,"name":"Factory-Reconditioned Delonghi Airstream Digital Convection Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E5HyjotNL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Refurbished Air Stream Convection Oven. This oven is so hot its cool! The AD679 uses Convection Heating which is often found in professional grade ovens. Theres a fan inside the oven that distributes heat evenly and consistently throughout the inner chamber. You get consistent results, often at a fraction of the time of regular oven cooking time Amazon.com With digital controls including a clock/timer, this 1,500-watt countertop convection oven provides a temperature range of 140 to 450 degrees F for roasting, baking, broiling, and even defrosting and dehydrating. Because it circulates hot air, the oven cooks faster and more uniformly than a conventional oven. It also toasts bread, bagels, English muffins, and sandwiches, with seven browning settings for precise control. The oven's 0.5-cubic-foot interior accommodates a 9-inch pie or six slices of toast. With two wire racks instead of the usual one, it also holds two sheets of cookies, and there's a preprogrammed cookie-baking time-and-temperature setting for one-touch convenience. Included with the oven are two aluminum cookie sheets that fit on the racks as well as an enamel baking pan with a broil insert. The interior, illuminated by a light and visible through the oven's glass door, is enamel for easy cleaning. A slide-out crumb tray also eases cleaning. The exterior is white steel with black steel and synthetic accents. The oven measures 18 inches wide, 8-1/2 inches high, and 12-1/2 inches deep and carries a one-year warranty against defects. --Fred Brack Editor's note: This is a reconditioned small appliance. Reconditioned generally means that the appliance has been returned to the manufacturer, who returns the appliance to like-new condition. Some appliances may contain cosmetic blemishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E5HyjotNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B00064XSS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00064XSS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00064XSS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":358166,"name":"Nurch Manual Food Chopper, Powerful Hand Crank Vegetable Processor, Compact and Portable Onion Dicer Garlic Cutter with Detachable Handle for Onions, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-ARC8GyML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🧄Make Prep Easy Garlic Chopper - The food processor is equipped with 3 stainless steel blades, so that the upper and lower blades can evenly crush the food from multiple angles. With this food chopper, you can make delicious dishes easily and simply. It also perfect gifts for various holidays and leisure occasions. 🍅Multipurpose Vegetable Processor - Perfect for cutting and stirring vegetables and fruits without hard seeds. Just place the ingredients to the container, twist and lock the lid, and then crank the handle. With it, you won’t shed tears when cutting onions. 🌿Easy to Use Mini Dicer - The sealed design of the hand crank food chopper can protect your fingers from the blades during use, and always keep the kitchen tidy during use. Just rotate the handle according to your needs for the size of the food. The bottom of the vegetable cutter is equipped with a non-slip base, which makes the operation more stable and labor-saving. 🧅Unique Design Onion Cutter - The crank of hand food chopper is detachable, you can insert the crank into different holes on the lid to get food of different sizes. One hole is the normal speed of blade rotation, and the other is twice the speed of blade rotation. Its humanized design meets your various needs! 🥩Conventient & Efficient Meat Mincer – Most parts of the veggie chopper can be easily disassembled for easy cleaning. After use, just rinse with water and drip dry. The blade is sharp, please be careful when cleaning. Fit for all kitchens, RVs, travel and camping. You can use it anytime, anywhere. Buy with confidence now! Noted: It cannot be used in dishwashers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-ARC8GyML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nurch","source_asin":"B08JTQ8KQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JTQ8KQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JTQ8KQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":358167,"name":"True Induction - TIGOURMET 10-Piece Tri-ply Stainless Steel Induction Cookware Set Silver, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":316.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hiklRyKvL.jpg","description":"True Induction's line of surgical stainless steel gourmet cookware is engineered to maximize the quality and benefits of induction cooking. Included in set are the 2.5 L pot, 5.0 L pot with lid, small saute pan with lid, 1.5 L saucepan with lid, saute pan and wok with lid. Lids are interchangeable within the set. The entire line of True Induction gourmet cookware has a number of stand-out features. One feature of this gourmet cookware is the riveted stainless steel handle. Each piece of True Induction cookware has a riveted handle or handles that never come off. The rivets are located outside of the cooking area, making the pieces safer and easier to clean. You won't have to worry about food getting stuck in the rivets while cooking, cutting the chances of bacteria growth between uses. Another feature is the sturdy tri-ply construction. The outer layer of each piece of True Induction cookware is conductive stainless steel designed to absorb the maximum amount of energy from the induction cooking field. The middle layer is composed of thermal conductive aluminum, which provides the perfect balance of heat conductivity, producing even cooking. The final layer of True Induction cookware is surgical grade stainless steel. Surgical grade stainless steel is naturally resistant to food sticking to the bottom of the cookware without the use of a chemical coating. Each pan has been ergonomically designed for functionality, sophistication and ease of use with volume measurement located on the pot insides. The lids on True Induction gourmet cookware are made of tempered glass, are heat resistant and the handles feature a thermal silicone seal. The handle and rim of each lid is made of stainless steel. True Induction gourmet cookware pieces are dishwasher safe. They can be used with any cooking method from range tops to induction cookers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hiklRyKvL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"True Induction","source_asin":"B00JPHX2RC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JPHX2RC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JPHX2RC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
