window.products.push({"id":358251,"name":"Nano Towels Body Bath & Shower Towel. Huge & Super Absorbent. Wipes Away Dirt, Oil and Cosmetics. Use As Your Sports, Travel, Fitness, Kids, Beauty, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811Vv2U3WzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DRY YOUR SKIN FASTER WHILE CLEANING DEEP INTO YOUR PORES WITH THE NANO TOWELS BODY TOWEL A TRUE REVOLUTION FOR YOUR SKIN. Did you know when you take a shower or wash your face, your skin isn’t completely clean? This is because soap and a cotton towel only clean the surface of your skin. The skin contains billions of tiny pores. Through daily life, those pores get tiny dirt and debris lodged in them which causes our skin to be unhealthy. If you use skin creams, sunblock, soap, makeup or anything else on your skin, you need to be able to get it OUT of your skin after using it so your pores can breathe. If the pores remain clogged, the chemicals from these skin additives can absorb into the body and into your bloodstream, nervous system and internal organs. The NanoTowels Body line uses an amazing, proprietary fiber called Nanolon that is small enough to reach deep into your pores, & actually trap and pull the dirt, debris, dead skin cells, pollutants, and makeup out of the skin. And it does this using only water. No soap or harsh and toxic chemicals are necessary, which is much healthier for your skin. Rub your skin a little in typically hard to clean areas like around the neck, back of the ears, creases of your face, etc and clean right into the pores. This also gets out the remnants of makeup, soaps and other things that get into and clog our pores and cause premature aging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811Vv2U3WzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Life Miracle","source_asin":"B07N44YTKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N44YTKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N44YTKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
