window.products.push({"id":358491,"name":"36 Pack Adhesive Hooks Heavy Duty Wall Hooks Transparent Reusable Hooks 30lb(Max) Waterproof and Oilproof for Bathroom and Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TEOhct-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Color: Transparent ,clear Package Quantity: Clear Hooks-36 Packs Material: PVC + Stainless steelDimensions: 2.4*2.4 inLoad Bearing: 30 Pound(Max) How to install: 1. Before installing the adhesive hook, please make sure the surface is clean, dry, free from dust and oil, and wipe it dry first. 2. Remove the transparent film on the back of the hook. 3. Paste on any smooth surface and press it tightly to remove any bubbles. 4.Maximum load: 30lbs. It is recommended to leave 24 hours before hanging any item to ensure the product is firm and fixed.Notes: 1. Do not hang overweight, expensive or fragile products. 2. Do not use in high temperature environment (no more than 80 degrees). 3. Applicable to all kinds of smooth surfaces, such as ceramic tile, marble, glass, stainless steel, wood, metal or plastic. 4.Not suitable for wallpaper, paint, painted walls and rough surfaces. Once stuck to the surface, the wall may be damaged. How to delete: Heat it with a hair dryer, then slowly remove it from the side without leaving a trace. Warm tips:1.These hooks can hold up to 30Ib. But we'd like to suggest no more than 30Ib for a long time.2.Our hooks can be used on smooth Tile, Metal, Glass, Laminates, and other smooth solid surfaces, but don’t use our hooks on textured walls or surfaces, wallpaper, brick, fabric, other rough or not stick surfaces, painted walls.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TEOhct-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YINUOYOUJIA","source_asin":"B08SJZQ18R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJZQ18R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJZQ18R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
