window.products.push({"id":358772,"name":"Bioeartha Waterproof Mattress Pad, Queen Size Quilted Fitted Mattress Pad, 100% Waterproof Breathable Soft Mattress Protector Stretches up to 8-18 inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bQc2VtZrL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"【100% Waterproof Mattress pad】: The mattress protector has a 100% high-quality TPU waterproof layer, which can protect your mattress and prevent sweat, urine, accidental liquid or night accidents from giving you unnecessary trouble. It is very suitable for families with children, the elderly, the sick, pregnant women, and children. 【Breathable & Lower Noise】: The mattress pad perfectly combines high-quality Microfiber material with a breathable surface layer, which can evenly dissipate heat and adjust the body temperature. It has good water absorption, air permeability and flexibility. The waterproof interlayer is made of high-quality elastic material. When you move on the bed, it will not make any plastic noise and no noise. It will bring you a quiet and comfortable sleeping condition. 【Deep pocket design】 : Our mattress pad has a deep pocket design, It can be as deep as 18 inches, suitable for most mattresses. The 360° deep pocket design ensures that the protective pad tightly holds the mattress, It has excellent ductility and elasticity, and can accommodate mattresses of most thicknesses to prevent the mattress cover from moving and alleviate your troubles. 【Easy to clean】: machine washable and dry to keep the mattress clean and fresh. The waterproof bed is neither thick nor thin, it can be washed and dried repeatedly, our waterproof interlayer will not be damaged. (Life Tips: When washing, please use cold water to wash, low temperature and low speed drying, so as not to damage the waterproof membrane. Remember, do not bleach and dry clean.) 【Satisfactory Service】: We have enough confidence in our products, and believe that after you use them, you will like them extremely. If you have any questions about our products or orders, please contact us in time and we will provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bQc2VtZrL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bioeartha","source_asin":"B08XJLV9KP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XJLV9KP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XJLV9KP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
