window.products.push({"id":358805,"name":"Dust Mite- and Allergen-Proof Pillow; “ComfortFill/Premium Microfiber” (Travel Size)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FyHXGTAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The MISSION: ALLERGY Premium Microfiber Fabric on the outside of these pillows is the ultimate allergen-barrier: totally effective, silky soft, lightweight, and imperceptible beneath the pillowcase. It is extremely tightly woven, with a mean pore size of 2 microns to block all allergens, yet is breathable (air-permeable), making it completely comfortable to sleep on. It is not hot and sweaty, as are barrier-fabrics made with membranes; does not allow any allergen escape, as do many cotton barrier-fabrics; and does not accumulate surface allergen, as do barrier fabrics made with terry cloth or non-woven fabric. These MISSION: ALLERGY Allergen-Proof Pillows are filled with ComfortFill, an economical quality filling providing firmness and comfort. These medical-grade pillows are suitable for adults or children with allergic asthma, allergic rhinitis, or allergic eczema (or simply for good hygiene). They are an excellent allergen-proof pillow for comfort, protection, and durability. 100% Woven Polyester Microfiber shell; 100% polyester filling. Note: These allergen-proof pillows are available exclusively from MISSION: ALLERGY. Do not confuse them with other pillows sold as “hypoallergenic”. The term “hypoallergenic” refers only to the fact that the interior filling of the pillow does not itself cause allergy—not to whether it can become colonized with dust mites! Our pillows have a Premium Microfiber allergen-barrier exterior, and thus cannot become colonized with mites (or bedbugs). They therefore do not require encasing or hot water washing. “Be sure you get … from a reputable company, like Mission Allergy…” THE NEW YORK TIMES \"Much Ado About Dust Mites\" “Say sayonara to dust mites. Dr. Fost recommends Mission: Allergy.” HEALTH MAGAZINE \"How healthy is your bedroom?\" “Skip the cheapie versions…invest in Mission: Allergy Premium Microfiber…” MEN'S HEALTH MAGAZINE \"Clearing the Air on Allergies\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FyHXGTAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mission","source_asin":"B07BW99ZFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BW99ZFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BW99ZFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":358806,"name":"Maxam 9-Element Cookware Heavy Surgical Stainless Steel Construction High Dome Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+Se2w1RQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Take home this wonderful collection of one of the highest quality Steam Control waterless cookware sets on the market today. The Maxam 9-Element 17 Piece Waterless Cookware set features extra-heavy stainless steel construction, so durable it’s guaranteed to last a lifetime! Steam Control valves make \"waterless\" cooking easy and the 9-element construction spreads heat quickly and evenly, allowing one to stack cook. Waterless cooking without added oil is healthy cooking and eating! The mirror finish exterior and satin finish interior combine in a classic design elegant enough to go from stove top to dinner table. The handles are superbly styled and are resistant to heat, cold, and detergents. Before you invest thousands of dollars in cookware, consider the advantages and superior features of this Maxam Steam Control 17 piece set. Limited lifetime warranty. Gift boxed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+Se2w1RQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maxam","source_asin":"B01N02J8EN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N02J8EN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N02J8EN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
