window.products.push({"id":358852,"name":"FLEXTAILGEAR Tiny Pump X Portable Air Pump+ Camping Light Ultra-Mini Air Pump with 1300mAh Battery USB Rechargeable for Pool Floats Air Bed Air Mattre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gjxmzy1ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤【ULTRA-MINI SIZE & PORTABLE】- FLEXTAILGEAR TINY PUMP X weights: 3.1 oz; Size: 2*1.7*1.7 inch; the portable air pump is mini as an egg and light-weighted. Portable to carry, this air mattress pump can be attached to the backpack or put in your pocket. One-button operation, widely used for outdoor camping, hiking, beach, and indoor storage bags. (NOTE: Double click to start the air pump and long press to open the led light.) ➤【POWERFUL IN/DEFLATION】- Powerful 3.5 kPa air pressure and fast 180L/min wind speed make Flextailgear tiny air pump X achieve fast inflation & deflation. Well saturation function after inflation, and increase work efficiency than normal electric air pumps. Able to inflate 4-5 swim rings, 6-8 single camping air mattress, 1-2 thick air cushion, or deflate 10-12 storage bags after one charging. Help to make a fire with air-blow function on outdoor camping (not suitable for balloons). ➤【PRACTICAL CAMPING LIGHT】- The bottom camping light emits 4500k white light(8 LED beads) for wide range lightning and high brightness. 3-level brightness adjustment: High(400 lumen)/Medium(160 Lumen)/Low(40 Lumen) to tackle with different illumination needs. Fit for camping tent, night walking, power outage, etc. ➤【1300mAh RECHARGEABLE BATTERY】- With 1300mAh lithium battery, our travel air pump works up to 15 minutes after fully charged. The fast type-c port supports 4 ways of charging: power bank, laptop, car charger, or power adapter. Bring Flextailgear TINY PUMP X with you, no need of socket or outdoor power supply. Convenient charging indicators: green for finished, and red for 0-99% status. ➤【5 NOZZLES & DIVERSE USE】- Come with 5 nozzles, our small air pump is suitable for most small-large sized inflatable products, such as air mattresses, inflatable beds, pool floats, sleeping pads, swim rings, inflatable furniture, pool inflatables and other inflatable toys. Made of solid ABS material and great sealing technology, this rechargeable air pump is sturdy, well-sealed and durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gjxmzy1ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FLEXTAILGEAR","source_asin":"B088ZM687P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088ZM687P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088ZM687P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
