window.products.push({"id":358865,"name":"LavishLifeGroup Crescent Moon Shelf Wall Decor – Moon Phase Wall Shelf - Cute Handmade Moon Shelf for Crystals and Crystal Shelf Display – Perfect for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B1cGQKBhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Functional storage never looked so good as with the LavishLifeGroup Rustic Moon Shelf Unit . The raw, crescent moon with cascading stairway design paired with lightweight, fine-grained natural paulownia wood gives an effortlessly cool edge, transforming any room decor into timeless rustic elegance. Eye-Catching Moon Design Typically ornamental in attractive moon crescent form, our black moon shelf pairs beautiful designs with a practical storage solution. Easy to blend in with existing styles or create a new look of its own to grace all surroundings with its appeal and homely feel. Great as a hippie room decor for the bedroom or boho wall decor for the living room, our moon wall shelf is ready to hang anywhere to bring some texture and interest to your room. Decorate & Organize, At Once! You can place our wood moon shelf throughout the home to organize and decorate any room - a great way to minimize clutter and make a feature of your wall. Versatile and practical in purpose, these wooden shelves make a cute essential oil shelf and crystal storage shelf while attention-demanding wall decor for bedroom or living room. Possibilities are endless! Durable, Reliable, Secure Our floating moon crystal shelf is purpose-designed with safety, protection, and toughness in purpose: Natural paulownia wood is robust and of the highest strength to support your stones collection Natural paulownia wood is robust and of the highest strength to support your stones collection The included reliable hardware provides ultimate support to wall fixing The included reliable hardware provides ultimate support to wall fixing Preassembled for Easy Wall-Mounted Fixing Our wall hanging shelf is ready to enjoy in minutes. Conveniently preassembled for minimum effort and including mounting screws and anchors, you can immediately organize and decorate your room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B1cGQKBhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LavishLifeGroup","source_asin":"B08XQ4M3GT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XQ4M3GT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XQ4M3GT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
