window.products.push({"id":358874,"name":"Atlas Signs and Plaques Mini Stickley No Solicitors Plaque 8x2 - Raised Bronze Metal Coated Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NCTB9FMIL._AC_.jpg","description":"From our popular Stickley Collection of Arts and Crafts Plaques. The Stickley No Solicitor sign in the \"Mini\" version uses the Rennie Mackintosh Font and coordinates with the rest of your Stickley house plaques. Mark your territory with style. Signs ship three weeks from payment date as they are made to order custom sign by crafts people in the USA.   Our Signs and Plaques have a base of modern 30 pound High Density Urethane (HDU) board (a type of plastic). This is a product that was developed for the aerospace industry and has been used for signage for over 40 years. It's highly desirable because it is light weight, waterproof, easily carved, will last decades in an exterior environment is cost efficient.   We coat our HDU with a cold applied real metal coating that is in use world-wide as an architectural and industrial coating. It is a well-proven, tough, and beautiful coating that gives the look of cast metal without the limitations of weight and cost. Therefore, when you receive your order, you will notice that it is light weight. Since it is HDU with a thin metal coating, it is light and easy to hang on any wall without fear of testing the building's structural integrity. (As in the 5' round Copper Plaque crafted for the U.S. Coast Guard Academy, weighing in at only 60 pounds compared to hundreds if it were made of foundry casting.)   Our signs and plaques receive a marine grade lacquer coating prior to shipment. \"Marine Grade\" means that the coating is designed to protect even in harsh coastal environments. That being said, our metal coatings are a \"living finish\" and you can expect some changes over time even though they are protected with a high-quality protective clear coat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NCTB9FMIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atlas Signs and Plaques","source_asin":"B00I9K9V8U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I9K9V8U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I9K9V8U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
