window.products.push({"id":358879,"name":"Kyrieval 5 Packs Wine Bags for Travel, Wine Travel bags for Wine Bottles, Inflatable Wine Bottle Protector for Travel Shipping, wine skins for travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EaNx31DfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to use the wine bags for travel: Step 1. Find the wine shipping sleeve's inflation port, follow the direction of the green arrow, you can find it with the hand twist; Step 2. Push the top part of the inflator into the inflation port, and try not to leak air out; 3. Remove inflator out directly after the wine sleeves is full of air, this wine shipping bags can seal itself automatically. Wine bottle travel protector bags: Our wine travel bags are made of high quality PE/PA, which provide great toughness, stretchability and sturdiness. 9 layers of co-extrusion film can effectively protect fragile bottles from damage. Size of the wine sleeves for travel: Before inflation-9.3 * 16.14 in; After inflation: 6.1 * 14.37 in. Our wine bags for travel fit for most standard size (750ml) bottles. You can put beer bottles, whiskey bottles, glasses, perfume bottles and more fragile products. High safety wine shipping bags: Each of wine bottle protector has 14 air columns bubble cushion wrap, independent of each other, even if one of them breaks, it will not affect the protection ability of other air columns. Wide range of applications: Inflatable wine protector bags for travel can be applied to a variety of scenarios, such as travel, relocate, delivery, shipping. They can effectively keep your items safe in transit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EaNx31DfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kyrieval","source_asin":"B0B4223WGJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4223WGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4223WGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
