window.products.push({"id":358988,"name":"Flash Furniture Kyndl Kids Solid Hardwood Table and Chair Set for Playroom, Bedroom, Kitchen - 3 Piece Set - Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.81,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sC+x7jXaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In a world where everything is always too big or too tall, life can be frustrating for your little ones so give them a space that is uniquely theirs where their feet will actually touch the floor. This natural finish, solid wood table and 2 chairs set is the perfect place for a child's creative endeavors, a safe place for clay and markers and the perfect spot for snacks or dinner time. Having their own table and chairs teaches practical skills like wiping the table after meals and encourages independence so they can do things for themselves. When you are looking for seating that will hold those most precious to you, quality construction is key. mortise and tenon construction has been used for years by master craftsmen and is one of the strongest, most stable joints especially for right angles. Metal screws serve as reinforcements giving this kids wood table and chair set exceptional strength and durability. Recommended for ages 5-7, this wood table and 2 chairs set will hold up to 170 lbs. Rounded edges help keep children safe from sharp corners. We know you want to spend quality time with your children not putting things together so this set assembles in under an hour with the included tools. Easily clean up messes with water and follow with a dry cloth to keep this wooden kids table and chairs set looking new. The space saving design of this set allows it to be used in the living room, dining room, play room, kitchen or bedroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sC+x7jXaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B08X2T4DDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-358988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X2T4DDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X2T4DDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
