window.products.push({"id":359001,"name":"GAUCHO-MARKET Yerba Mate Cup Gourd Set Kit, Bombilla Straw and Brush. Insulated Double Wall Glass Keeps Water Hot and Protects your Hands from Heat, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FB0iyU1tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"YERBA MATE SET – Our insulated double-wall glass yerba mate cup is the perfect way to enjoy your traditional South American beverage, yerba mate. Made with double-walled borosilicate glass, this cup is designed to keep your yerba mate hot while keeping your hands cool to the touch. THE CUP - The double-glass construction provides a clear view of the yerba mate infusion, allowing you to appreciate the color, aroma and the quality of the leaves. It keeps the original Yerba taste and it's easy to clean. The second layer design keeps your fingers safe from heat and your drink warm without any worries! It has a smooth finish and a crystal clear look. Together, with its beautiful shape, the glass adds the nicest look for the perfect Mate. The ideal design for the mate lover! MATERIAL - Made from top quality heat resistant borosilicate glass, stronger than regular glass. It is dishwasher safe and won't retain any taste or odor, making it perfect for daily use. The materials used are also eco-friendly and sustainable. BENEFITS - Yerba mate has 90% more antioxidants than green tea, increasing oxygen quantities into the body cells. It contains B vitamins essential for the body, potassium and magnesium. Its vaso relaxation capabilities increases body circulation, reducing heart deseases. DESIGN - Drinking yerba mate from a traditional mate cup is a great way to connect with South American culture, and the double-glass design of our cup gives it a modern twist. It's perfect for those who want to enjoy the traditional drink but with a more contemporary feel and the added benefits of insulation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FB0iyU1tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAUCHO-MARKET","source_asin":"B0C4BBNLK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4BBNLK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4BBNLK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
